Added domain validation tracking: DCV method of a certificate (DNS, HTTP, email, ACME dns-01 / http-01 / tls-alpn-01) and Domain Validation Records (TXT / CNAME records used for validation, such as `_acme-challenge` delegations) linked to certificates, with an optional comparison with Nautobot DNS Models (present, different or absent, computed and never stored) and a link to create a missing record there.
